  "notes": "Cash basis; governmental funds only (no business-type funds). Statement lines from the Total column p4. 'Other Taxes' 1,432,124 split using the Inheritance Tax Fund schedule (p7, Inheritance Tax 1,429,021); the remaining 3,103 keeps the Other Taxes label. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets, Liabilities and Fund Balance (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail from the budget schedules for General, Road/Bridge, Inheritance Tax and Federal Aid Secondary funds; the nonmajor combining schedule p9 has 11 fund columns, so its Actual Total Nonmajor column is used (fund 'Nonmajor funds (combined)'). Inheritance Tax schedule p7 prints two budget columns; the one the variance is computed from (300,000 receipts) is used as final. County Clerk and Register of Deeds office statements (p10-11) are custodial office accounts and are skipped. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
}
